{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>We are sons of one man</b> — and they did not say אנחנו, a hint that one of them was missing." "<b>We are</b> — three times in the Masorah: here; נחנו נעבור חלוצים; נחנו פשענו. And this is what they expounded: they said נחנו — to kill the entire city we came, if he does not give him to us; and this is because נחנו נעבור חלוצים — to fight if he does not give him to us to redeem him; therefore נחנו פשענו." "<b>You are spies</b> — meaning, and not I, for Joshua who would come forth from him was not in the counsel of the spies. And they said לא היו עבדיך מרגלים — meaning, Judah answered him, for he was the head of the speakers; also from me came Caleb, who was not in the counsel of the spies." "<b>They were not</b> — in gematria: כלב."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:17.393219750Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}